  "decisions": [
    "Repeating 5 magazine capacity is five actual bolts; the Soldier class kit supplies 20 carried bolts and starts the magazine empty.",
    "A legal attack attempt spends one loaded bolt independent of hit result; no sixth shot is available.",
    "Reload transfers no more than free capacity from carried stock and requires a free loading hand. A caller must separately charge the sourced Action.",
    "No spare-magazine multiplication, automatic refill, or ammunition creation is allowed."
  ],
